        "title": "归: X归X，Y归Y separates issues",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "X归X，Y归Y separates two issues so that one does not settle the other. It differs from physically returning an object.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "工作归工作，生活归生活。",
                "pinyin": "gōngzuò guī gōngzuò ， shēnghuó guī shēnghuó 。",
                "meaning": "Work is work, and personal life is personal life.",
                "audio": "3f38fb75f32e5545d8d9904241eae053f031fbff01a26ab0624faf4ad228f11e"
              },
              {
                "text": "朋友归朋友，原则归原则。",
                "pinyin": "péngyou guī péngyou ， yuánzé guī yuánzé 。",
